    "body": "This appears to be correct for fixing tc39/ecma262#871 in HTML, but it could be that I'm missing some HTML-specific details, because I simply don't know the HTML spec that well. :smile: \r\n\r\nAnd I'm still wondering if calling `GetActiveScriptOrModule` and creating a new execution context (or its equivalent in actual implementations), will be an expensive operation in implementations, because it needs to be done whenever a new Promise Job gets enqueued. Well, let's just see what implementors think of this change. ",
